# .chore-backlog

Parking lot for repo hygiene and "make this actually work" items. Not campaign canon —
nothing here belongs in `codex/`. Written in English because it is infrastructure, not
table material; switch it to pt-BR if you'd rather.

Convention: `[ ]` open, `[x]` done, `[~]` in progress. Newest sections at the bottom.
When an item is done, keep the line and mark it — the history is useful.

